OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain possible at first this evening,
OL,7,Fmainly to the south and east of
OL,8,FGlasgow, but soon mainly dry. Clear
OL,9,Fspells developing and rather chilly by
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells, but cloud building with a few
OL,14,Fscattered showers. Drier and brighter
OL,15,Fagain later.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,18,Fspells and occasional heavy showers on
OL,19,FFriday. The showers lighter and well
OL,20,Fscattered on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,21,Fmore in the way of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
